      "writtenOn": "2021-12-20T21:37:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The goal is to zero out the stencil right? So depthFail is the case where the stencil passed and the depth failed. So (at least in the kNotEqual case) this should be kZero right? In general for cover step depthFail \u003d\u003d dsPass for normal or inverse right?",
